<!--
  Hand-written on purpose, for now.

  Four URLs is not worth an integration and its config. `@astrojs/sitemap`
  earns its place when the tool pages (#111) arrive and the list stops being
  something a person can read at a glance — at which point a URL added
  without a matching line here becomes a real possibility rather than a
  theoretical one.

  Until then the failure mode runs the other way: an integration is one more
  thing that can silently drop a page, and two of the four below are cited in
  store submission material.
-->
